WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.558
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind how technology affects

00:00:05.558 --> 00:00:06.045
communities.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:12.072
Benefit: is a helpful effect of technology. Risk: is a possible harmful result.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:18.350
Healthcare: can use technology to support patients. Farming: can use sensors and

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.401
weather data. Privacy: means controlling access to personal information.

00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:28.167
Create a class safety demonstration. Show a good example of benefit and risk and

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.259
explain why the good practice matters.
